{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Army</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636000/extras/building.gif?t=1749138575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin battle with few production buildings and grow into an unstoppable force. Production buildings are continuously creating new units, forming the composition of your army. What you decide to build will determine strengths and weaknesses of your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636000/extras/ability.gif?t=1749138575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every unit has its own unique look and ability. Majority of abilities are useful most of the time and some abilities are more specialized that give you more ways to outplay your opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Engaging Multiplayer Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636000/extras/ultimate_strike.gif?t=1749138575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host or join intense multiplayer matches. You can join any public lobby or create your own. You can host a private lobby with your friends and play in tournaments against each other or play together in CO-OP mode. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story Single-Player Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636000/extras/gif_campaign.gif?t=1749138575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an exciting single-player campaign, filled with tactical challenges, strategic decisions, and storytelling. Protect your strongholds, discover hidden threats, and lead your forces to victory.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"EMBERS OF WAR","pat